2026-06-30 15:01:39 | INFO | summarizer.py:93 | execute | Summarizer memory[3]: [{'type': 'thinking', 'thinking': "The file doesn't exist, so I'll create it."}, {'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'call_00_UmgvKDL4WXDzDeAaMXw38303', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/macbook/.copaw/workspaces/default/memory/2026-06-30.md', 'content': '# Memory — 2026-06-30\n\n## Persistent Memory\n\n### User Profile\n- User is using Agent CMS (YamlCMS workspace)\n- User is Russian-speaking, interested in personal finance tracking\n- User has collections: Игры, Музыка, Книги, Фильмы\n- User values structure and visual organization (covers, screenshots)\n\n### Financial Topics Created/Configured\n1. **Финансы.Доходы** (`awn-container/finansydohody/`)\n   - File mask: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{id}`\n   - Memory fields: Сумма (awn.number, required), Источник (awn.string, required), Категория дохода (awn.enum: Зарплата, Фриланс, Инвестиции, Подарок, Другое)\n   - Records: Зарплата за май (55 000 ₽, Основная работа, Зарплата)\n\n2. **Финансы.Расходы** (`awn-container/finansyrashody/`)\n   - File mask: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{id}`\n   - Memory fields: Сумма (awn.number, required), Категория (awn.enum: Еда, Транспорт, Связь, Коммуналка, Развлечения, Здоровье, Другое)\n   - Records: Кофе 250₽ (Еда), Магазин 1000₽ (Еда), Телефон 300₽ (Связь), Проезд 80₽ (Транспорт)\n\n3. **Финансы.Инвестиции** (`awn-container/finansyinvestitsii/`)\n   - Memory fields: Дата вложения (awn.date, required), Дата окончания (awn.date), Банк (awn.string, required), Процентная ставка (awn.number, required)\n   - Records: Вклад Сбербанк 100 000₽ (12% годовых)\n\n### Game Collection (`awn-container/kollektsii/igry/`)\n- **Migrated from single-file (main.md) to multi-file (individual .md records)**\n- Games with records:\n   - GTA 3 — cover: Wikipedia EN\n   - Mafia 1 — cover: Wikipedia EN\n   - Warcraft 3 — cover: Wikipedia EN\n   - Дальнобойщики 2 (Hard Truck 2: King of the Road) — cover: Wikipedia RU\n- Single-file memory (main.md) was cleared\n- Emoji removed from game entries\n\n### Other Topics\n- **Дневник** (`awn-container/dnevnik/`) — has journal template, old entries from Feb-Mar 2026, no custom fields\n- **Музыка** (`awn-container/kollektsii/muzyka/`) — single-file memory with YouTube playlist, no records\n- **Идеи, Карьера, В работе** — topics without custom configs\n\n## Reflections & Logic\n\n### Custom Fields in Agent CMS\n- Schema is configured in `config.yml` under `awn_schema`\n- For **topic-level** fields: `awn_schema.topic.fields`\n- For **memory** (Память) fields: `awn_schema.slot_memory.fields`\n- Supported field types: `awn.number`, `awn.string`, `awn.text`, `awn.enum`, `awn.date`, `awn.file`, `awn.boolean`, `awn.integer`, `awn.url`\n- Enum values MUST use expanded YAML format (not inline `{key: name}`):\n  ```yaml\n  enum:\n    - key: zarplata\n      name: "Зарплата"\n  ```\n  The inline format `{ key: zarplata, name: "Зарплата" }` is NOT parsed correctly by the system (becomes option_1, option_2...).\n\n### File Masks\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{id}` creates nested folder structure (year/month/day/file)\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{id}` creates year/month/file structure\n- Format: `{YYYY}-{MM}-{DD}-{id}` creates flat files with date prefix\n- Masks take effect on NEW file creation, existing files are not moved\n\n### Preview Images\n- `awn-preview` field in frontmatter accepts external URLs (type `awn.url`)\n- Preview images load in Agent CMS interface\n- For game covers: Wikipedia EN/RU box art images are reliable sources\n- For local storage: media slot exists but no direct upload API available via MCP tools\n\n### Steam API for Screenshots\n- Store API: `https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids={APP_ID}&cc=us&l=en`\n- Returns screenshots array with `path_full` URLs\n- ⚠️ Steam App IDs must be verified — appid 317040 is **Strife: Veteran Edition**, NOT Hard Truck 2\n- Correct App ID for Hard Truck 2: King of the Road is **4487840**\n- Image URL pattern: `https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/{APP_ID}/{HASH}/ss_{HASH}.1920x1080.jpg`\n- API may return `success: false` if app is not available in certain regions or requires store page parameters\n\n### Browser Tool Limitations\n- Headless mode triggers CAPTCHA/Cloudflare on many sites (Google, Bing, MobyGames, GiantBomb, IGDB, IGROMANIA)\n- Wikipedia (both EN and RU) works in headless mode\n- Steam store API works via curl (not via browser navigate)\n- `evaluate()` function has limited JavaScript syntax support (no `var`, `let`, `const` — use simple expressions instead)\n- File system storage is virtual — physical paths not directly accessible for `awn-container` topics\n\n### External Memory Management\n- `create_external_memory` uses file mask for naming (new files follow mask pattern)\n- `write_external_memory` updates content with frontmatter fields\n- No delete/remove tool available for external memory files — workaround: overwrite with status: closed and minimal content\n- Existing files with same title get `-2`, `-3` suffix when new files are created\n'}, 'raw_input': '{"file_path": "/Users/macbook/.copaw/workspaces/default/memory/2026-06-30.md", "content": "# Memory — 2026-06-30\\n\\n## Persistent Memory\\n\\n### User Profile\\n- User is using Agent CMS (YamlCMS workspace)\\n- User is Russian-speaking, interested in personal finance tracking\\n- User has collections: Игры, Музыка, Книги, Фильмы\\n- User values structure and visual organization (covers, screenshots)\\n\\n### Financial Topics Created/Configured\\n1. **Финансы.Доходы** (`awn-container/finansydohody/`)\\n   - File mask: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{id}`\\n   - Memory fields: Сумма (awn.number, required), Источник (awn.string, required), Категория дохода (awn.enum: Зарплата, Фриланс, Инвестиции, Подарок, Другое)\\n   - Records: Зарплата за май (55 000 ₽, Основная работа, Зарплата)\\n\\n2. **Финансы.Расходы** (`awn-container/finansyrashody/`)\\n   - File mask: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{id}`\\n   - Memory fields: Сумма (awn.number, required), Категория (awn.enum: Еда, Транспорт, Связь, Коммуналка, Развлечения, Здоровье, Другое)\\n   - Records: Кофе 250₽ (Еда), Магазин 1000₽ (Еда), Телефон 300₽ (Связь), Проезд 80₽ (Транспорт)\\n\\n3. **Финансы.Инвестиции** (`awn-container/finansyinvestitsii/`)\\n   - Memory fields: Дата вложения (awn.date, required), Дата окончания (awn.date), Банк (awn.string, required), Процентная ставка (awn.number, required)\\n   - Records: Вклад Сбербанк 100 000₽ (12% годовых)\\n\\n### Game Collection (`awn-container/kollektsii/igry/`)\\n- **Migrated from single-file (main.md) to multi-file (individual .md records)**\\n- Games with records:\\n   - GTA 3 — cover: Wikipedia EN\\n   - Mafia 1 — cover: Wikipedia EN\\n   - Warcraft 3 — cover: Wikipedia EN\\n   - Дальнобойщики 2 (Hard Truck 2: King of the Road) — cover: Wikipedia RU\\n- Single-file memory (main.md) was cleared\\n- Emoji removed from game entries\\n\\n### Other Topics\\n- **Дневник** (`awn-container/dnevnik/`) — has journal template, old entries from Feb-Mar 2026, no custom fields\\n- **Музыка** (`awn-container/kollektsii/muzyka/`) — single-file memory with YouTube playlist, no records\\n- **Идеи, Карьера, В работе** — topics without custom configs\\n\\n## Reflections & Logic\\n\\n### Custom Fields in Agent CMS\\n- Schema is configured in `config.yml` under `awn_schema`\\n- For **topic-level** fields: `awn_schema.topic.fields`\\n- For **memory** (Память) fields: `awn_schema.slot_memory.fields`\\n- Supported field types: `awn.number`, `awn.string`, `awn.text`, `awn.enum`, `awn.date`, `awn.file`, `awn.boolean`, `awn.integer`, `awn.url`\\n- Enum values MUST use expanded YAML format (not inline `{key: name}`):\\n  ```yaml\\n  enum:\\n    - key: zarplata\\n      name: \\"Зарплата\\"\\n  ```\\n  The inline format `{ key: zarplata, name: \\"Зарплата\\" }` is NOT parsed correctly by the system (becomes option_1, option_2...).\\n\\n### File Masks\\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{id}` creates nested folder structure (year/month/day/file)\\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{id}` creates year/month/file structure\\n- Format: `{YYYY}-{MM}-{DD}-{id}` creates flat files with date prefix\\n- Masks take effect on NEW file creation, existing files are not moved\\n\\n### Preview Images\\n- `awn-preview` field in frontmatter accepts external URLs (type `awn.url`)\\n- Preview images load in Agent CMS interface\\n- For game covers: Wikipedia EN/RU box art images are reliable sources\\n- For local storage: media slot exists but no direct upload API available via MCP tools\\n\\n### Steam API for Screenshots\\n- Store API: `https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids={APP_ID}&cc=us&l=en`\\n- Returns screenshots array with `path_full` URLs\\n- ⚠️ Steam App IDs must be verified — appid 317040 is **Strife: Veteran Edition**, NOT Hard Truck 2\\n- Correct App ID for Hard Truck 2: King of the Road is **4487840**\\n- Image URL pattern: `https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/{APP_ID}/{HASH}/ss_{HASH}.1920x1080.jpg`\\n- API may return `success: false` if app is not available in certain regions or requires store page parameters\\n\\n### Browser Tool Limitations\\n- Headless mode triggers CAPTCHA/Cloudflare on many sites (Google, Bing, MobyGames, GiantBomb, IGDB, IGROMANIA)\\n- Wikipedia (both EN and RU) works in headless mode\\n- Steam store API works via curl (not via browser navigate)\\n- `evaluate()` function has limited JavaScript syntax support (no `var`, `let`, `const` — use simple expressions instead)\\n- File system storage is virtual — physical paths not directly accessible for `awn-container` topics\\n\\n### External Memory Management\\n- `create_external_memory` uses file mask for naming (new files follow mask pattern)\\n- `write_external_memory` updates content with frontmatter fields\\n- No delete/remove tool available for external memory files — workaround: overwrite with status: closed and minimal content\\n- Existing files with same title get `-2`, `-3` suffix when new files are created\\n"}'}]
