old entries from Feb-Mar 2026, no custom fields\n- **Музыка** (`awn-container/kollektsii/muzyka/`) — single-file memory with YouTube playlist, no records\n- **Идеи, Карьера, В работе** — topics without custom configs\n\n## Reflections & Logic\n\n### Custom Fields in Agent CMS\n- Schema is configured in `config.yml` under `awn_schema`\n- For **topic-level** fields: `awn_schema.topic.fields`\n- For **memory** (Память) fields: `awn_schema.slot_memory.fields`\n- Supported field types: `awn.number`, `awn.string`, `awn.text`, `awn.enum`, `awn.date`, `awn.file`, `awn.boolean`, `awn.integer`, `awn.url`\n- Enum values MUST use expanded YAML format (not inline `{key: name}`):\n  ```yaml\n  enum:\n    - key: zarplata\n      name: "Зарплата"\n  ```\n  The inline format `{ key: zarplata, name: "Зарплата" }` is NOT parsed correctly by the system (becomes option_1, option_2...).\n\n### File Masks\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{DD}/{id}` creates nested folder structure (year/month/day/file)\n- Format: `{YYYY}/{MM}/{id}` creates year/month/file structure\n- Format: `{YYYY}-{MM}-{DD}-{id}` creates flat files with date prefix\n- Masks take effect on NEW file creation, existing files are not moved\n\n### Preview Images\n- `awn-preview` field in frontmatter accepts external URLs (type `awn.url`)\n- Preview images load in Agent CMS interface\n- For game covers: Wikipedia EN/RU box art images are reliable sources\n- For local storage: media slot exists but no direct upload API available via MCP tools\n\n### Steam API for Screenshots\n- Store API: `https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids={APP_ID}&cc=us&l=en`\n- Returns screenshots array with `path_full` URLs\n- ⚠️ Steam App IDs must be verified — appid 317040 is **Strife: Veteran Edition**, NOT Hard Truck 2\n- Correct App ID for Hard Truck 2: King of the Road is **4487840**\n- Image URL pattern: `https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/{APP_ID}/{HASH}/ss_{HASH}.1920x1080.jpg`\n- API may return `success: false` if app is not available in certain regions or requires store page parameters\n\n### Browser Tool Limitations\n- Headless mode triggers CAPTCHA/Cloudflare on many sites (Google, Bing, MobyGames, GiantBomb, IGDB, IGROMANIA)\n- Wikipedia (both EN and RU) works in headless mode\n- Steam store API works via curl (not via browser navigate)\n- `evaluate()` function has limited JavaScript syntax support (no `var`, `let`, `const` — use simple expressions instead)\n- File system storage is virtual — physical paths not directly accessible for `awn-container` topics\n\n### Claw Agents Collection\n- Created multi-file memory for **7 Claw agents** under `awn-container/kollektsii/issleduem-claw-agenty/`\n- Agents documented: OpenClaw (381k⭐), Agent Zero, Hermes Agent / gbrain (24.6k⭐), CoPaw, ZeroClaw (5k⭐), MicroClaw (726⭐, Rust/ESP32), MetaClaw (3.4k⭐, self-learning)\n- OpenClaw ecosystem explored: openclaw.ai, ClawHub, gbrain (Garry Tan), aiming-lab/MetaClaw, microclaw/microclaw\n\n### External Memory Management\n- `create_external_memory` uses file mask for naming (new files follow mask pattern)\n- `write_external_memory` updates content with frontmatter fields\n- No delete/remove tool available for external memory files — workaround: overwrite with status: closed and minimal content\n- Existing files with same title get `-2`, `-3` suffix when new files are created\n'}]}]
